# =============================================================================
# .gitignore for er2-data-analysis (public version)
# =============================================================================
# This repo intentionally does not track raw data. Datasets contain potentially
# identifying respondent information and are kept locally only.
# See Datasets/README.md and Data Analysis/Codebook/README.md for the expected
# schema if you want to bring your own data and run the analysis scripts.
# =============================================================================

